 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "routes is a list of [from, cost, to] with string checkpoint names and cost >= 0; checkpoints is a list of [name, reward] with reward >= 0 (a name not listed has reward 0). The routes form a DAG. A path starts at the checkpoint named \"lodge\" and ends at a finish line, which is any checkpoint with no outgoing route. Its score is the sum of rewards of every checkpoint arrived at after the lodge minus the sum of route costs. Return the maximum score over all such paths (0 when the lodge has no outgoing route).",
  "provenance": [
